  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/yNQGVddj/yeehaw-banner.png\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.21及以上版本需要 Architectury API</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Yeehaw Towns 是一款小型模组，新增了由灾厄村民居住的西部风格城镇。这些城镇可生成于任何类似沙漠的模组生物群系中，并包含近似原版的战利品。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>未来计划</strong></p>\n<p>- 骑乘马匹的西部牛仔灾厄村民，Yeehaw！</p>\n<p>- 可能的模组集成</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>截图</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/43hRYV9y/2024-08-05-16-04-05.png\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/QdHRz1Sm/2024-08-05-16-09-08.png\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/bJkPBkyW/2024-08-05-16-02-37.png\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/YCPw2bjT/2024-08-05-16-04-41.png\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/gjsfCKfS/2024-08-05-16-06-08.png\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PxWG4HKk/2024-08-05-16-04-56.png\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/K8j2ydcn/2024-08-05-16-03-06.png\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/8Py2wtds/2024-08-05-16-07-49.png\"></p>",
